  "solution": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "### 1. Simplify the Function",
      "isVertical": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "Break the fraction into two separate terms by dividing each part of the numerator by $x^{power_n}$:",
      "isVertical": true
    },
    {
      "type": "mathLatex",
      "content": "f(x) = {step1_f}",
      "isDisplayMode": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "Now, simplify each term:",
      "isVertical": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "• The first term simplifies to ${num_a} (since $x^{power_n}/x^{power_n} = 1$).",
      "isVertical": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "• The second term can be rewritten using a **negative exponent**: $\\frac{{num_b}}{x^{power_n}} = {num_b}x^{-{power_n}}$.",
      "isVertical": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "So, the simplified function is:",
      "isVertical": true
    },
    {
      "type": "mathLatex",
      "content": "f(x) = {simplified_final}",
      "isDisplayMode": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "--------------------------------------------------------",
      "isVertical": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "### 2. Apply the Power Rule",
      "isVertical": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "Now we differentiate each term individually.",
      "isVertical": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "• The derivative of a constant (${num_a}$) is 0.",
      "isVertical": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "• The derivative of $x^{-{power_n}}$: Bring the exponent down to the front and subtract 1 from the power.",
      "isVertical": true
    },
    {
      "type": "mathLatex",
      "content": "({num_b}x^{-{power_n}})' = {coeff}x^{-{power_n}-1} = {coeff}x^{-{new_power}}",
      "isDisplayMode": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "--------------------------------------------------------",
      "isVertical": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "### 3. Final Result",
      "isVertical": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "Putting the parts back together:",
      "isVertical": true
    },
    {
      "type": "mathLatex",
      "content": "f'(x) = 0 + {coeff}x^{-{new_power}}",
      "isDisplayMode": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "To express the answer with a positive exponent (standard mathematical form):",
      "isVertical": true
    },
    {
      "type": "mathLatex",
      "content": "f'(x) = {final_ans}",
      "isDisplayMode": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "**Final Answer:**",
      "isVertical": true
    },
    {
      "type": "mathLatex",
      "content": "f'(x) = {final_ans}",
      "isDisplayMode": true
    }
  ],
